%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-system-functions-envvars (関数ページ)
実行ごとに変わる部分は %%% mask / %%% env / %%% variants で扱う (docs/fixtures.md)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import dw::System
output application/json
---
{ "envVars" : dw::System::envVars().SHELL }
%%% env
SHELL=/bin/bash
HOME=/home/test
%%% output application/json
{
  "envVars": "/bin/bash"
}
